  "description": "NFT Showroom is a platform for showcasing digital assets that aims to make engaging with NFTs approachable and safe for everyone, not just crypto-natives. It puts a friendly front-end on what can otherwise be an intimidating space.\n\nOn-chain logic is written in Solidity and accessed through Web3.js and MetaMask, while a Python/Django and Django REST Framework backend with PostgreSQL serves the application's API. The client side is built with React Native and Vite.js/Node.js tooling.",
